  "description": "Test build of Aurora's Across the Veil as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Aurora so her hop into the spirit realm (invisible, faster) comes when she is low on health with an enemy on top of her, instead of the data pack's stand-in (any enemy champion on top of her), which cannot read health; and picks the moment for her Between Worlds as a good Aurora player does (a crowd trapped with friends near, a low one trapped, a diver slammed - otherwise held). Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
